# k.kinds/shards/sensitive: the 86 words of k.words whose first noun sense is a weapon (45), a drug (4), an alcoholic drink (34) or tobacco (3): hosts leave them out of suggestions and random choices by default (the categories of the GARM Brand Safety Floor; the rule in tools/sensitive-core.mjs)
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (the hypernym chains of the first noun sense of each word, as imported in k.words; the words whose everyday sense differs, sources/hand-core/sensitive-not.tsv, are left out)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/sensitive-core.mjs

@k.kinds.sensitivity.Cognac k.kinds.sensitivity name=Cognac sensitive=alcohol sense=k.words.cognac.noun.1 core.source="wordnet 3.1"
